{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a story of <strong>split personality</strong>, where Jack faces a <strong>horrifying</strong> reality: his inner world is no longer under his control. McKinsey, a ruthless and amoral <strong>psychopath</strong>, is tearing his life apart. The only way to get rid of him is through <strong>therapy</strong>. But will that truly solve the problem? McKinsey <strong>threatens</strong> Jack with the loss of everything he holds dear. Can his loved ones survive? And is McKinsey really that dangerous, or is his existence just a part of <strong>something greater</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010180/extras/ManTalking.gif?t=1743091838\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Intriguing narrative with 5 available endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hallucinations that intensify as you progress, distorting reality and affecting the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Handcrafted by a solo developer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Many locations to explore  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Your choices do affect the story </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010180/extras/JasonChoice.gif?t=1743091838\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>story-driven adventure game</strong>, players will interact with Jack's world and his visions. Go through <strong>7 days</strong> and set things up so you can get into therapy, without McKinsey understanding. <strong>Interact</strong> with other characters who can help you, <strong>solve puzzles</strong> and act <strong>tricky.</strong> Otherwise McKinsey won't go easy on you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010180/extras/Cards.gif?t=1743091838\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3010180?t=1743091838","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743091838","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010180/53d6871b662addf5289a82978257e45d41e03a10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743091838","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010180/53d6871b662addf5289a82978257e45d41e03a10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743091838","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game content may include: references to suicide, unscientific descriptions of mental illnesses and references to threats."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a story of <strong>split personality</strong>, where Jack faces a <strong>horrifying</strong> reality: his inner world is no longer under his control. McKinsey, a ruthless and amoral <strong>psychopath</strong>, is tearing his life apart. The only way to get rid of him is through <strong>therapy</strong>. But will that truly solve the problem? McKinsey <strong>threatens</strong> Jack with the loss of everything he holds dear. Can his loved ones survive? And is McKinsey really that dangerous, or is his existence just a part of <strong>something greater</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010180/extras/ManTalking.gif?t=1743091838\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Intriguing narrative with 5 available endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph